  Description: Either through witnessing their deeds and devout heroics firsthand,
    or through reading chronicles of their exploits, the Shining Sentinels of the
    Knights of Lastwall inspire you. You may idealize their philosophy or one day
    hope to join their ranks; the Shining Sentinels are your guiding star. Choose
    two attribute boosts. One must be to Strength or Charisma , and one is a free
    attribute boost. You're trained in the Diplomacy skill and the Shining Sentinels
    Lore skill. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.No Cause for Alarm]
    skill feat.
